From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sliva0 <sliva0mk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:22:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diameter: Rename IP-Realm-Default-Indicator to
 IP-Realm-Default-Indication

3GPP TS 32.299 clause 7.2.80A defines AVP 2603 as
IP-Realm-Default-Indication; table 7.2.0.1 and the SDP-Media-Component
body in clause 7.2.180 agree. Checked against V18.0.0.

Renaming an AVP renames its display filter field
(diameter.IP-Realm-Default-Indicator becomes
diameter.IP-Realm-Default-Indication), so saved filters and profiles
using the old name need updating.
---
 resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
index 56a8586..f53c21f 100644
--- a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
+++ b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
@@ -7528,7 +7528,7 @@
 			<enum name="NO" code="0"/>
 			<enum name="YES" code="1"/>
 		</avp>
-		<avp name="IP-Realm-Default-Indicator" code="2603" vendor-bit="must" vendor-id="TGPP">
+		<avp name="IP-Realm-Default-Indication" code="2603" vendor-bit="must" vendor-id="TGPP">
 			<type type-name="Enumerated"/>
 			<enum name="Default IP Realm Not used" code="0"/>
 			<enum name="Default IP realm used" code="1"/>
